      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "That weight isn't a burden to drop—it's the proof of how deeply you loved, and it will soften with time, even if it never fully disappears. You don't have to perform for anyone; let yourself be raw and honest, because that's where healing actually begins. And when the tiredness feels unbearable, remember that you're not carrying it alone—there are people who would hold it with you if you let them.",
